<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 106-3 CHASING NZ SELECTION'S 138.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 106-3 CHASING NZ SELECTION'S 138.</headline>
<dateline>PALMERSTON NORTH, New Zealand 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>England reached 106 for three in their first innings in reply to the New Zealand Selection XI's 138 all out on the first day of their four-day tour match on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand Selection XI 138 (Craig Spearman 41, Craig White 4-15)</p>
<p>England 106 for three (Nick Knight 46, Alec Stewart 40 not out)</p>
